# =============================================================================
# Web3Forms Access Key for A to Z Fitness Enquiry Form
# =============================================================================
# How to get your free access key:
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com
# 2. Enter the gym's official email: atozcontactus@gmail.com
# 3. Check atozcontactus@gmail.com inbox for the access key email.
# 4. Create a local `.env` file in this directory and paste the key below:
#
# NOTE: In Vite, variables prefixed with VITE_ are exposed to client-side code.
# Web3Forms access keys are designed specifically for client-side forms.
# Never store private email passwords or secret server tokens here.
# =============================================================================

VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your_web3forms_access_key_here
